      "_note_returning": "RETURNING ACTIONS: `const r = await dsx.action.name(args)` binds { ok: true, data: <the action's `return <expr>` value, null when it never returns> } — the dsx.module success-envelope shape. Deterministic on every runtime: actions stay synchronous (they only suspend at their OWN awaits), so the natives bind inline and the walk continues; un-awaited calls are byte-identical to before.",
